	(text_box "Note: \n\nThe overall system overview has a separate project file that can be found in the parent diretory. This schematic ia for only the EPS.\n\nThe power subsystem supplies the power for both boards. The global labels R5V and R3V3 are used system wide.\n\nThe 20x2 stackup connecter has extra pins because they are unused in this system but 20x2 headers are necessary for compatibility."
